Package: glmnetUI
Title: Interactive Shiny Interface for Elastic Net Modeling with 'glmnet'
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("William", "Craytor", , "bcraytor@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A self-contained Shiny application for interactive elastic net
    regression modeling using 'glmnet'. Provides point-and-click variable
    selection, alpha/lambda tuning with cross-validation, coefficient sign
    warnings for model defensibility, diagnostic plots, and formatted report
    export. Designed for real estate appraisers and general regression users
    who need an accessible interface for regularized regression.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/wcraytor/glmnetUI
